            "review_title": "Review at Die Leckerei - Café & Speiselokal",
            "review_text": "AnnaMaier\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\na hidden germ\nFeb 2023 • Friends\nThis place is like a hidden germ - if you are fond of luxurious, gorgeous, nice decorated cafe & restaurent, this place is not for you. \n\nI enjoy an unusual yuzu soda (Japanese yellow citrus mixed with carrbonated water), have to admit it´s more refreshing than a coke. The view to the opposite villa is full of green and peace that makes me want to stay longer. So I ordered some snack. \n\nDon´t judge the eatery from the look. It´´s simple but offers high quality imported Germany specialities.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 27, 2023",
