            "review_title": "Review at Die Leckerei - Café & Speiselokal",
            "review_text": "AnatasiaMuller\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam14 contributions\n0\nValued\nJan 2023\nAs this is a German store, selected qualitative imported German sausages, German & Austrian bread, German & Swiss beer are the main products. \n\nFor non-alcoholic prefered, highly recommend yuzu soda or yuzu oolong. Yuzu is Japanese yellow citrus, known for it strong aroma and high Vitamin C. Ginger beer imported from the UK is also top-notch.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 27, 2023",
